            <ArticleTitle>[Does heart disease recur following heart transplantation?].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>581-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The long follow-up after heart transplantation is influenced by the occurrence of graft-coronary artery disease. This complication remains a diagnostic, prognostic and therapeutical dilemma. This short review gives an insight into the principal aspects concerning this complication.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
